  - stochastic games
abstract: >-
  SwarmBench is a Python benchmark for strategic edge nodes in a repeated,
  budgeted proportional-share auction among edge nodes with
  CES utilities, service floors and battery dynamics. It provides a catalog of
  36 agents from fixed rules to planners and learned policies, three benchmark
  modes, reference points and stored results that can be re-run and checked score by score.
